*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0001
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-08-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 940
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0001.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY INT0001C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> APPLIED INTEREST RATE
    05 INTEREST-RATE      PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM APPLY-INT-TIER
    DISPLAY "INTEREST-RATE=" INTEREST-RATE
    STOP RUN.
APPLY-INT-TIER.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> TOP SAVINGS TIER - LIMIT 37500 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN ACCT-TYPE = 'S' AND ACCT-BALANCE >= 75000
            MOVE 0.0425 TO INTEREST-RATE
        WHEN ACCT-TYPE = 'S' AND ACCT-BALANCE >= 10000
            MOVE 0.0325 TO INTEREST-RATE
        WHEN ACCT-TYPE = 'S'
            MOVE 0.0250 TO INTEREST-RATE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.0050 TO INTEREST-RATE
    END-EVALUATE.
